sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Deployer A
  box rgb(237,243,248) OCC process
    participant API as API / lifecycle<br/>Audit / selected IAM
  end
  participant DB as State / PostgreSQL
  participant W as Lifecycle worker
  actor C as Reader C

  Note over A,C: 1 · Accept lifecycle work
  A->>API: Create, update, deploy or stop
  API->>API: Authenticate and authorize primary action<br/>Validate producer fact
  API->>DB: Original transaction: mutation + evidence + work
  DB->>DB: Guard order, retention lock<br/>Trusted receipt and sequence
  DB-->>API: Acknowledged COMMIT
  API-->>A: Local acceptance

  Note over A,C: 2 · Observe owned work
  W->>DB: Claim accepted work and original causation
  DB-->>W: Owned work
  W->>W: Perform lifecycle work<br/>Establish only observed facts
  W->>DB: Append observed or unknown fact
  DB-->>W: Committed evidence
  Note over DB,W: Queue completion does not prove<br/>physical stop or provider success.

  Note over A,C: 3 · Query one historical Agent
  C->>API: GET exact-Agent History
  API->>API: Authenticate current reader<br/>Bind IAM read intent in State write unit
  API->>DB: Installation, account/session, policy,<br/>resource guards, then retention FOR SHARE
  DB-->>API: Locks acquired
  API->>DB: Sample time after lock<br/>Current authorization and indexed query
  DB-->>API: Eligible bounded events<br/>State receipt and decimal sequence

  Note over A,C: 4 · Commit disclosure before bytes
  API->>API: Reauthorize exact historical Agent
  API->>DB: Append disclosure evidence and COMMIT
  alt Acknowledged COMMIT and release rule holds
    DB-->>API: Evidence committed
    API-->>C: Safe page and optional cursor
  else Failed or unknown commit
    API->>API: Classify refused or unknown COMMIT
    API-->>C: Sanitized error, no protected page
  end
  Note over API,C: Expiry-crossing release remains an owner decision.<br/>No silent resampling or extended eligibility.

  Note over A,C: 5 · Preserve uncertainty
  Note over A,DB: Exact mutation recovery observes local acceptance only.<br/>Missing or erased evidence stays unknown. No replay.
  Note over A,C: Proposed composition, not installed qualification.<br/>Time flows downward. Solid arrows request, dashed arrows reply.
